{"seq":1,"slug":"dna-structure-replication","title":"DNA 结构与复制（DNA Structure and Replication）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/biochemistry/nucleic-acids-genetics/dna-structure-replication","wordCount":2482,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"dna-结构与复制-dna-structure-and-replication\">DNA 结构与复制（DNA Structure and Replication）</h1><h2 id=\"引言\">引言</h2><p>脱氧核糖核酸（Deoxyribonucleic Acid, DNA）是地球上绝大多数生物的遗传物质载体。DNA 分子以其优雅的双螺旋结构忠实存储并传递遗传信息，确保物种的延续和个体的发育。1953 年 James Watson 和 Francis Crick 提出 DNA 双螺旋模型，是 20 世纪最伟大的科学发现之一，开启了分子生物学时代。</p>\n<p>DNA 复制是细胞分裂前的必要过程，确保每个子细胞获得完整的遗传信息拷贝。从大肠杆菌到人类，DNA 复制机器的基本逻辑惊人地保守：半保留复制、双向复制叉、多种酶协同参与。同时，精密的校对和修复系统将复制错误率降低到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 每碱基对每次复制，维护基因组完整性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>DNA（脱氧核糖核酸）</strong> 是绝大多数生物储存和传递遗传信息的分子；<strong>DNA 复制（DNA replication）</strong> 是在细胞分裂前以亲本链为模板合成子代 DNA、确保遗传信息完整传递的过程。掌握本主题需把握五个核心要素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>化学基础</strong>：DNA 由脱氧核苷酸通过 3&#39;,5&#39;-磷酸二酯键聚合而成，链有 5&#39;→3&#39; 方向性。</li>\n<li><strong>碱基互补配对</strong>：A 与 T、G 与 C 通过氢键互补配对（Chargaff 规则），是信息编码与精确复制的分子逻辑。</li>\n<li><strong>双螺旋</strong>：两条反平行链缠绕成右手双螺旋，碱基在内、糖-磷酸骨架在外，碱基堆积力是稳定双螺旋的主要力量。</li>\n<li><strong>拓扑约束</strong>：环形 DNA 的连接数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Lk = Tw + Wr</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 被拓扑异构酶动态调节，负超螺旋有利于解旋起始。</li>\n<li><strong>复制机制与保真</strong>：半保留复制、双向复制叉、多种酶协同，配合聚合酶选择性与校对、错配修复，将错误率降至约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/bp。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>边界与常见误解</strong>：氢键并非稳定双螺旋的唯一力量——<strong>碱基堆积作用</strong>对稳定性的贡献甚至超过氢键，这解释了为何高 GC 含量 DNA 熔点更高。此外，&quot;DNA 复制是从一个起点向一个方向进行&quot;不成立：复制通常是<strong>双向</strong>的，真核生物还使用多个起点。从化学组成到复制的层级关系可概括为：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  N[脱氧核苷酸] --&gt; C[共价 3&#39;,5&#39;-磷酸二酯键聚合]&#10;  C --&gt; S[多核苷酸链 5&#39;→3&#39;]&#10;  S --&gt; H[互补碱基配对 A-T / G-C]&#10;  H --&gt; D[反平行双螺旋 B-DNA]&#10;  D --&gt; T[拓扑: Lk = Tw + Wr]&#10;  T --&gt; R[半保留复制 / 双向复制叉]&#10;  R --&gt; F[校对 + 错配修复 保真]\">graph TD\n  N[脱氧核苷酸] --&gt; C[共价 3',5'-磷酸二酯键聚合]\n  C --&gt; S[多核苷酸链 5'→3']\n  S --&gt; H[互补碱基配对 A-T / G-C]\n  H --&gt; D[反平行双螺旋 B-DNA]\n  D --&gt; T[拓扑: Lk = Tw + Wr]\n  T --&gt; R[半保留复制 / 双向复制叉]\n  R --&gt; F[校对 + 错配修复 保真]</pre><h2 id=\"dna-的化学组成与一级结构\">DNA 的化学组成与一级结构</h2><h3 id=\"核苷酸单元\">核苷酸单元</h3><p>DNA 的单体单位是脱氧核苷酸（deoxyribonucleotide），由三部分组成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>含氮碱基</strong>：嘌呤类（腺嘌呤 A、鸟嘌呤 G）和嘧啶类（胞嘧啶 C、胸腺嘧啶 T）</li>\n<li><strong>五碳糖</strong>：2&#39;-脱氧核糖（2&#39;-deoxyribose），C2&#39; 位置缺少羟基</li>\n<li><strong>磷酸基团</strong>：连接相邻核苷酸的 3&#39;-OH 和 5&#39;-OH</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核苷酸通过 3&#39;,5&#39;-磷酸二酯键聚合形成多核苷酸链。链具有方向性：5&#39; 端有游离磷酸基（或羟基），3&#39; 端有游离 3&#39;-OH。按照惯例，核酸序列从 5&#39; 向 3&#39; 方向书写。</p>\n<h3 id=\"chargaff-规则\">Chargaff 规则</h3><p>1950 年，Erwin Chargaff 发现不同物种 DNA 中，腺嘌呤含量等于胸腺嘧啶含量（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[A] = [T]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>），鸟嘌呤含量等于胞嘧啶含量（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[G] = [C]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>）。这一&quot;碱基配对规则&quot;成为 Watson-Crick 双螺旋模型的关键实验依据。但不同物种的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[A+T]/[G+C]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 比值各不相同，反映了物种特异性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"watson-crick-双螺旋结构\">Watson-Crick 双螺旋结构</h2><h3 id=\"b-dna-的结构参数\">B-DNA 的结构参数</h3><p>经典 B 型 DNA 双螺旋的主要特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>两条反平行的多核苷酸链围绕共同轴心缠绕，形成右手螺旋</li>\n<li>碱基对位于螺旋内部，糖-磷酸骨架在外侧</li>\n<li>每圈包含约 10 个碱基对，螺距为 3.4 nm</li>\n<li>双螺旋直径约 2.0 nm</li>\n<li>存在大沟（major groove，宽约 2.2 nm）和小沟（minor groove，宽约 1.2 nm）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"碱基配对与堆积力\">碱基配对与堆积力</h3><p>互补碱基之间通过 Watson-Crick 氢键配对：A-T 形成两个氢键，G-C 形成三个氢键。G-C 碱基对的额外氢键使高 GC 含量的 DNA 具有更高的热稳定性（更高的熔解温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p>碱基堆积作用（base stacking）是稳定双螺旋的主要热力学力量——平面芳环碱基沿螺旋轴方向堆叠，产生 van der Waals 力和疏水效应。堆积作用的贡献甚至超过氢键对双螺旋稳定性的贡献。</p>\n<h3 id=\"dna-的结构多态性\">DNA 的结构多态性</h3><p>除经典 B-DNA 外，DNA 还可采取其他构象：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A-DNA</strong>：右手螺旋，每圈 11 bp，碱基对相对于螺旋轴倾斜约 20°。在脱水条件下形成，也存在于 DNA-RNA 杂交双链中</li>\n<li><strong>Z-DNA</strong>：左手螺旋，交替嘌呤-嘧啶序列在高盐或负超螺旋条件下可形成。Z-DNA 可能在基因调控中发挥作用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"超螺旋与拓扑学\">超螺旋与拓扑学</h2><h3 id=\"连接数与超螺旋\">连接数与超螺旋</h3><p>环形 DNA（如质粒和细菌染色体）的拓扑性质由连接数（Linking number, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Lk</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>）描述：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Lk = Tw + Wr</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Tw</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>（Twist）为双链绕轴的缠绕圈数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Wr</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（Writhe）为 DNA 轴本身的盘绕程度。在松弛状态下，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>10.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Lk_0 = N/10.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/10.5</span></span></span></span></span>（N 为碱基对数）。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta Lk = Lk - Lk_0 &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时为负超螺旋（underwound），有利于局部 DNA 解旋，促进转录和复制的起始。大多数原核生物和真核生物的基因组 DNA 处于负超螺旋状态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"拓扑异构酶\">拓扑异构酶</h3><p>拓扑异构酶通过暂时切断和重新连接 DNA 链来改变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Lk</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>I 型拓扑异构酶</strong>：切断一条链，使另一条链穿过缺口，每次改变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Lk</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> ±1</li>\n<li><strong>II 型拓扑异构酶</strong>（如 DNA 旋转酶）：切断双链，使另一段双链穿过，每次改变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Lk</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> ±2。细菌 DNA 旋转酶利用 ATP 水解引入负超螺旋，是氟喹诺酮类抗生素的靶点</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"dna-复制机制\">DNA 复制机制</h2><h3 id=\"半保留复制\">半保留复制</h3><p>Meselson 和 Stahl 的经典实验（1958 年）利用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{15}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>N 密度标记证明 DNA 以半保留方式复制：每个子代 DNA 分子保留一条亲本链并新合成一条互补链。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复制起始\">复制起始</h3><p>复制从特定的复制起点（origin of replication, ori）开始。大肠杆菌只有一个 ori（oriC），含有富含 AT 的重复序列便于解旋。DnaA 蛋白结合 oriC 后促进局部解链，随后 DnaB 解旋酶加载到单链 DNA 上。</p>\n<p>真核生物基因组在每条染色体上有数百到数千个复制起点，由 ORC（Origin Recognition Complex）识别。多起点复制确保大型基因组在有限 S 期内完成复制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复制叉的分子机器\">复制叉的分子机器</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>蛋白</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解旋酶（DnaB/MCM）</td>\n<td>解开双链 DNA，暴露单链模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单链结合蛋白（SSB/RPA）</td>\n<td>保护单链 DNA 不形成二级结构或被降解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引物酶（DnaG/Pol α）</td>\n<td>合成短 RNA 引物提供 3&#39;-OH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNA 聚合酶 III/ε（原核）<br>Pol δ/ε（真核）</td>\n<td>主要复制酶，5&#39;→3&#39; 合成并具 3&#39;→5&#39; 校对外切活性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动夹（β-clamp/PCNA）</td>\n<td>环形蛋白拥抱 DNA，提供聚合酶的进行性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNA 连接酶</td>\n<td>封闭 Okazaki 片段之间的切口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拓扑异构酶</td>\n<td>消除复制叉前方的正超螺旋</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"前导链与滞后链\">前导链与滞后链</h3><p>由于 DNA 聚合酶只能沿 5&#39;→3&#39; 方向合成，两条模板链的复制方式不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>前导链</strong>（leading strand）：连续合成，聚合酶跟随复制叉前进方向</li>\n<li><strong>滞后链</strong>（lagging strand）：不连续合成，产生 1000-2000 nt 的 Okazaki 片段（真核生物为 100-200 nt），需要反复引发、合成、去除引物、填补缺口和连接</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"复制的保真性\">复制的保真性</h3><p>DNA 复制的总错误率约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> /bp/复制周期，通过三层保障实现：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>聚合酶选择性</strong>：碱基配对的几何互补性（错误率 ~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li><strong>3&#39;→5&#39; 校对外切活性</strong>：聚合酶检测到错配后切除错误核苷酸（再降低 ~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li><strong>错配修复系统</strong>（MMR）：复制后识别并修正逃逸校对的错配（再降低 ~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"dna-损伤与修复\">DNA 损伤与修复</h2><h3 id=\"常见-dna-损伤类型\">常见 DNA 损伤类型</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>脱嘌呤/脱嘧啶</strong>：每个人体细胞每天约发生 5,000-10,000 次自发脱嘌呤</li>\n<li><strong>氧化损伤</strong>：活性氧（ROS）氧化碱基，最常见产物为 8-氧代鸟嘌呤（8-oxoG）</li>\n<li><strong>紫外线诱导</strong>：相邻嘧啶形成环丁烷嘧啶二聚体（CPD）</li>\n<li><strong>烷基化</strong>：化学试剂对碱基的烷基化修饰</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"主要修复通路\">主要修复通路</h3><p><strong>碱基切除修复（BER）</strong>：DNA 糖苷酶识别并切除损伤碱基，AP 内切核酸酶切开骨架，聚合酶填补缺口，连接酶封闭。</p>\n<p><strong>核苷酸切除修复（NER）</strong>：识别并切除含损伤碱基的 12-13 nt（原核）或 24-32 nt（真核）片段。NER 是修复 UV 损伤的主要通路，其缺陷导致着色性干皮病（Xeroderma Pigmentosum）。</p>\n<p><strong>错配修复（MMR）</strong>：识别新合成链上的错配（通过链的甲基化状态或切口区分新旧链），切除错配区段后重新合成。MMR 基因突变与遗传性非息肉病性结直肠癌（Lynch 综合征）密切相关。</p>\n<p><strong>双链断裂修复</strong>：同源重组（HR，高保真但需姐妹染色单体模板）和非同源末端连接（NHEJ，快速但易出错）。BRCA1/BRCA2 参与 HR 通路，其突变显著增加乳腺癌和卵巢癌风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>DNA 双螺旋结构的优雅与复制机器的精密互为因果。互补碱基配对既是信息编码的基础，也是精确复制的模板逻辑。多层次的保真性机制和多条修复通路共同保障基因组在代际传递和个体生命周期中的稳定性。DNA 损伤修复通路的缺陷与多种人类疾病（尤其是癌症）直接相关，使其成为精准医学的重要研究领域。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DNA 结构与复制（DNA Structure and Replication）","id":"dna-结构与复制-dna-structure-and-replication"},{"level":2,"text":"引言","id":"引言"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DNA 的化学组成与一级结构","id":"dna-的化学组成与一级结构"},{"level":3,"text":"核苷酸单元","id":"核苷酸单元"},{"level":3,"text":"Chargaff 规则","id":"chargaff-规则"},{"level":2,"text":"Watson-Crick 双螺旋结构","id":"watson-crick-双螺旋结构"},{"level":3,"text":"B-DNA 的结构参数","id":"b-dna-的结构参数"},{"level":3,"text":"碱基配对与堆积力","id":"碱基配对与堆积力"},{"level":3,"text":"DNA 的结构多态性","id":"dna-的结构多态性"},{"level":2,"text":"超螺旋与拓扑学","id":"超螺旋与拓扑学"},{"level":3,"text":"连接数与超螺旋","id":"连接数与超螺旋"},{"level":3,"text":"拓扑异构酶","id":"拓扑异构酶"},{"level":2,"text":"DNA 复制机制","id":"dna-复制机制"},{"level":3,"text":"半保留复制","id":"半保留复制"},{"level":3,"text":"复制起始","id":"复制起始"},{"level":3,"text":"复制叉的分子机器","id":"复制叉的分子机器"},{"level":3,"text":"前导链与滞后链","id":"前导链与滞后链"},{"level":3,"text":"复制的保真性","id":"复制的保真性"},{"level":2,"text":"DNA 损伤与修复","id":"dna-损伤与修复"},{"level":3,"text":"常见 DNA 损伤类型","id":"常见-dna-损伤类型"},{"level":3,"text":"主要修复通路","id":"主要修复通路"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"酶动力学与催化机理（Enzyme Kinetics and Catalytic Mechanisms）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/biochemistry/amino-acids-proteins/enzyme-kinetics"},"next":{"title":"转录与翻译（Transcription and Translation）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/biochemistry/nucleic-acids-genetics/transcription-translation"}}